{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/news/final-piece-in-place-for-defence-support-transformation","content_id":"7244d21f-0f4c-4d36-97eb-666543764fd8","description":"The National Armaments Director (NAD) Group has awarded the third and final major contract within the Business Modernisation for Support (BMfS) programme.  ","details":{"attachments":[],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><ul>\n  <li>£113 million contract awarded to Digital Allies consortium (PA Consulting and Accenture) to deliver Defence Logistics Information Services (<abbr title=\"Defence Logistics Information Services\">DLIS</abbr>)</li>\n  <li>Business Modernisation for Support (<abbr title=\"Business Modernisation for Support\">BMfS</abbr>) programme contracts now total £466 million, creating up to 170 jobs with potential for hundreds more</li>\n  <li>Programme will modernise ageing logistics systems to improve warfighter readiness and strengthen interoperability with NATO partners</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>The new contract will fund <abbr title=\"Defence Logistics Information Services\">DLIS</abbr>, providing defence with modern, digitally enabled capabilities for:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>warehousing</li>\n  <li>freight distribution</li>\n  <li>storage information services</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>This award represents the final element of the <abbr title=\"Business Modernisation for Support\">BMfS</abbr> programme’s delivery structure. It follows a £320 million contract for a Defence Equipment Engineering and Asset Management System, and a £33 million contract for Foundational Services - the ‘digital socket’ that <abbr title=\"Business Modernisation for Support\">BMfS</abbr>’ new solutions will all plug into.</p>\n\n<p>It enables <abbr title=\"Business Modernisation for Support\">BMfS</abbr> to move into delivery phase, bringing the programme’s intended outcomes – improved war fighter readiness, better interoperability across defence and with NATO, and enhanced national security – a step closer to reality.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"what-dlis-will-provide\">What <abbr title=\"Defence Logistics Information Services\">DLIS</abbr> will provide</h2>\n\n<p><abbr title=\"Defence Logistics Information Services\">DLIS</abbr> will give defence logistics users an efficient and flexible capability that can adapt to operational needs, replacing 10 different systems with a single, easy to use, digital solution. End users will benefit from streamlined processes for managing:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>inventory</li>\n  <li>munitions</li>\n  <li>warehousing and movements</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>The Digital Allies consortium’s software-based solution will provide defence-specific functionality designed to work effectively from implementation.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"investment-in-uk-industry\">Investment in UK industry</h2>\n\n<p>The 3 <abbr title=\"Business Modernisation for Support\">BMfS</abbr> contracts represent a significant investment in the UK defence industrial base.</p>\n\n<p>Together, they will directly create up to 170 highly skilled jobs in the UK, with potential for hundreds more, whilst sustaining the existing defence employment sector and strengthening supply chains.</p>\n\n<p>Luke Pollard, Minister of State for Defence Readiness and Industry, said:</p>\n\n<blockquote>\n  <p class=\"last-child\">We are meeting this new era of threat by making our Armed Forces more lethal. This programme will boost our national security by transforming how we provide our sailors, soldiers and aviators with the kit they need when they need it, whether at home or overseas.</p>\n</blockquote>\n\n<blockquote>\n\n</blockquote>\n\n<blockquote>\n  <p class=\"last-child\">Our investment of almost half a billion pounds to modernise this logistics and support system will create up to 170 UK jobs, making defence an engine for growth.</p>\n</blockquote>\n\n<h2 id=\"nad-group-delivering-transformation\">\n<abbr title=\"National Armaments Director\">NAD</abbr> Group delivering transformation</h2>\n\n<p>With all 3 contracts now in place, the <abbr title=\"National Armaments Director\">NAD</abbr> Group can begin delivery in earnest.</p>\n\n<p><abbr title=\"Business Modernisation for Support\">BMfS</abbr> will transform defence logistics through more efficient systems and standardised business processes, delivering enhanced readiness and operational advantage to the warfighter alongside improved interoperability across UK defence and with NATO partners.</p>\n\n<p>Rupert Pearce, National Armaments Director, said:</p>\n\n<blockquote>\n  <p class=\"last-child\">This contract marks a significant milestone in our mission to modernise defence’s logistics capabilities. By partnering with UK industry, we’re not only delivering cutting-edge digital solutions for our Armed Forces but also investing in British skills and innovation.</p>\n</blockquote>\n\n<blockquote>\n\n</blockquote>\n\n<blockquote>\n  <p class=\"last-child\">The <abbr title=\"National Armaments Director\">NAD</abbr> Group is committed to building the industrial partnerships that will sustain our national security for decades to come, and this award demonstrates that commitment in action.</p>\n</blockquote>\n\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"Number of jobs edited from 235 to 170","public_timestamp":"2026-02-25T08:31:08Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-02-24T15:55:00Z"}],"emphasised_organisations":["d994e55c-48c9-4795-b872-58d8ec98af12"],"images":[{"caption":null,"content_type":"image/jpeg","sources":{"s216":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/63495d46e90e0731ae2a1415/s216_ministry-of-defence-building.jpg","s300":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/63495d468fa8f5346732690e/s300_ministry-of-defence-building.jpg","s465":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/63495d468fa8f53468995326/s465_ministry-of-defence-building.jpg","s630":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/63495d46e90e0731a983a846/s630_ministry-of-defence-building.jpg","s712":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/63495d46e90e0731a4dcff75/s712_ministry-of-defence-building.jpg","s960":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/63495d46d3bf7f618eda94d2/s960_ministry-of-defence-building.jpg"},"type":"lead"}],"political":true},"document_type":"news_story","first_published_at":"2026-02-24T15:55:00+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/news/final-piece-in-place-for-defence-support-transformation","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/news/final-piece-in-place-for-defence-support-transformation","base_path":"/government/news/final-piece-in-place-for-defence-support-transformation","content_id":"7244d21f-0f4c-4d36-97eb-666543764fd8","document_type":"news_story","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-02-25T08:31:08Z","schema_name":"news_article","title":"Final piece in place for defence support transformation","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/news/final-piece-in-place-for-defence-support-transformation","withdrawn":false}],"emphasised_organisations":[{"analytics_identifier":"D17","api_path":"/api/content/government/organisations/ministry-of-defence","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/organisations/ministry-of-defence","base_path":"/government/organisations/ministry-of-defence","content_id":"d994e55c-48c9-4795-b872-58d8ec98af12","details":{"acronym":"MOD","brand":"ministry-of-defence","default_news_image":{"high_resolution_url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/63495d46d3bf7f618eda94d2/s960_ministry-of-defence-building.jpg","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/63495d468fa8f5346732690e/s300_ministry-of-defence-building.jpg"},"logo":{"crest":"mod","formatted_title":"Ministry<br/>of Defence"},"organisation_govuk_status":{"status":"live","updated_at":null,"url":null}},"document_type":"organisation","links":{},"locale":"en","schema_name":"organisation","title":"Ministry of Defence","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/organisations/ministry-of-defence","withdrawn":false}],"government":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/2024-starmer-labour-government","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/2024-starmer-labour-government","base_path":"/government/2024-starmer-labour-government","content_id":"9dbff654-cdeb-4ebe-9a12-cd4cc20a033e","details":{"current":false,"ended_on":"2026-07-20T00:00:00+00:00","started_on":"2024-07-05T00:00:00+00:00"},"document_type":"government","links":{},"locale":"en","title":"2024 to 2026 Starmer Labour government","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/2024-starmer-labour-government"}],"organisations":[{"analytics_identifier":"D17","api_path":"/api/content/government/organisations/ministry-of-defence","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/organisations/ministry-of-defence","base_path":"/government/organisations/ministry-of-defence","content_id":"d994e55c-48c9-4795-b872-58d8ec98af12","details":{"acronym":"MOD","brand":"ministry-of-defence","default_news_image":{"high_resolution_url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/63495d46d3bf7f618eda94d2/s960_ministry-of-defence-building.jpg","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/63495d468fa8f5346732690e/s300_ministry-of-defence-building.jpg"},"logo":{"crest":"mod","formatted_title":"Ministry<br/>of Defence"},"organisation_govuk_status":{"status":"live","updated_at":null,"url":null}},"document_type":"organisation","links":{},"locale":"en","schema_name":"organisation","title":"Ministry of Defence","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/organisations/ministry-of-defence","withdrawn":false}],"people":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/people/luke-pollard","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/people/luke-pollard","base_path":"/government/people/luke-pollard","content_id":"0e11b976-f017-4c29-b0f2-94468466af99","document_type":"person","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-07-22T15:26:00Z","schema_name":"person","title":"Luke Pollard MP","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/people/luke-pollard","withdrawn":false}],"primary_publishing_organisation":[{"analytics_identifier":"D17","api_path":"/api/content/government/organisations/ministry-of-defence","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/organisations/ministry-of-defence","base_path":"/government/organisations/ministry-of-defence","content_id":"d994e55c-48c9-4795-b872-58d8ec98af12","details":{"acronym":"MOD","brand":"ministry-of-defence","default_news_image":{"high_resolution_url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/63495d46d3bf7f618eda94d2/s960_ministry-of-defence-building.jpg","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/63495d468fa8f5346732690e/s300_ministry-of-defence-building.jpg"},"logo":{"crest":"mod","formatted_title":"Ministry<br/>of Defence"},"organisation_govuk_status":{"status":"live","updated_at":null,"url":null}},"document_type":"organisation","links":{},"locale":"en","schema_name":"organisation","title":"Ministry of Defence","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/organisations/ministry-of-defence","withdrawn":false}],"roles":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/ministers/minister-of-state--207","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/ministers/minister-of-state--207","base_path":"/government/ministers/minister-of-state--207","content_id":"47758af5-c983-42a1-bce4-e27428d164fb","details":{"body":"<ul>\n  <li>Implementation of relevant SDR Vision and Defence Investment Plan</li>\n  <li>Oversight of the National Armaments Director Group</li>\n  <li>Departmental communications strategy and reform</li>\n  <li>Armed forces readiness and stockpiles</li>\n  <li>Defence procurement, including reform and UK Defence Innovation</li>\n  <li>Submarine delivery</li>\n  <li>Defence Industrial Strategy implementation and Growth</li>\n  <li>Defence Exports Campaigns and Office</li>\n  <li>Defence Readiness Bill</li>\n  <li>Ukraine support - military aid and industrial partnerships, including HIRST and KINDRED</li>\n  <li>Defence industry relationships and the Defence Industrial Joint Council</li>\n  <li>UK Defence Innovation and artificial intelligence</li>\n  <li>Climate change and sustainability</li>\n  <li>Science and technology</li>\n  <li>Defence Afghanistan Relocation and Assistance Programme (ARAP) including eligibility applications and asylum</li>\n  <li>Oversight of Parliamentary engagement and AFPS</li>\n  <li>Defence Infrastructure Organisation and defence estates</li>\n</ul>\n","role_payment_type":null,"seniority":100,"whip_organisation":{}},"document_type":"ministerial_role","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-08-25T09:12:36Z","schema_name":"role","title":"Minister of State (Minister for Defence Readiness and Industry)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/ministers/minister-of-state--207","withdrawn":false}],"taxons":[{"api_path":"/api/content/defence/working-armed-forces","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/defence/working-armed-forces","base_path":"/defence/working-armed-forces","content_id":"8ff8cf05-a6e6-4757-a896-4fabd9f3229a","details":{"internal_name":"Armed forces [M] (level 2, defence theme)","notes_for_editors":"","visible_to_departmental_editors":false},"document_type":"taxon","links":{"parent_taxons":[{"api_path":"/api/content/defence-and-armed-forces","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/defence-and-armed-forces","base_path":"/defence-and-armed-forces","content_id":"e491505c-77ae-45b2-84be-8c94b94f6a2b","description":"","details":{"internal_name":"Defence and armed forces","notes_for_editors":"","visible_to_departmental_editors":true},"document_type":"taxon","links":{"root_taxon":[{"api_path":"/api/content/","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/","base_path":"/","content_id":"f3bbdec2-0e62-4520-a7fd-6ffd5d36e03a","document_type":"homepage","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-02-18T13:00:23Z","schema_name":"homepage","title":"GOV.UK homepage","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/","withdrawn":false}]},"locale":"en","p